	(text "LED matrix (Rev A) - design notes\n\n32 x 32 = 1024 LEDs, common-anode rows: LD(1000 + 100 x row + column), anode to ROWn (high-side AO3401A),\ncathode to COLn (TLC59283 sink). One row on at a time (1:32). LED part, pitch and peak current are\nPROTOTYPE-DEPENDENT (OD-03, QR screening); KT-0603W 0603 at 2.0 mm pitch is the current candidate.\nFront side of the board, with the two buttons when they fit (ADR 0008); everything else on the rear.\nNothing measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
